      "content": "Subject: Request for Additional Resources to Manage Project Scope\n\nDear [Boss's Name],\n\nI hope this message finds you well. I wanted to bring to your attention a matter that has been causing me some concern regarding our current project. As we continue to work diligently, I've noticed that the scope of the project is expanding significantly, and this is starting to impact our other sprints. \n\nIn the spirit of maintaining our high standards and ensuring the success of all our projects, I believe it would be beneficial to either add more team members to our current project or consider extending the deadline. This would allow us to manage the workload effectively and maintain the quality of our deliverables.\n\nI understand that these adjustments may require some consideration, but I am confident that with your support, we can find a solution that works best for everyone involved. I am more than willing to discuss this further and explore potential options.\n\nThank you for your understanding and support.\n\nBest regards,\n[Your Name]",
